This product is a translation into Rust of BeforeIT.jl
(https://github.com/bancaditalia/BeforeIT.jl) at commit
09263989b56bd2d58c28657bb8e940142d995cf4.
BeforeIT.jl: Copyright 2024 - Banca d'Italia and the authors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The files in data and tests/data are converted from files of BeforeIT.jl
(data and test/matlab_code); see data/README.md and tests/data/README.md.

The changes with respect to BeforeIT.jl are described in README.md, section
"Differences from BeforeIT.jl".

src/plots.rs also follows errorline of StatsPlots.jl, mean and std of
NaNMath.jl, the default attributes, minor ticks, axis widening and legend
placement of Plots.jl, the gradients of PlotUtils.jl and ColorSchemes.jl
and the bar plots of Makie.jl, and uses the colours of the default palette
of Plots.jl (computed by PlotUtils.jl) and named colours of Colors.jl;
these packages are under the MIT License. The gradients RdBu and YlOrRd
are ColorBrewer colour schemes, as ColorSchemes.jl stores them:
